      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\because f(0-0)=\\lim_{x\\rightarrow 0}e^{-\\frac{1}{2}}=e^{-\\frac{1}{2}}=f(0),\\\\&amp;\\therefore f(x) \\text{在}x=0 \\text{处的右极限，记为}y=[\\frac{(1+x)^{\\frac{1}{x}}}{e}]^{\\frac{1}{x}}, \\text{则}\\\\&amp;\\ln y=\\frac{\\ln(1+x)-x}{x^2}, \\text{而}\\lim_{x\\rightarrow 0+}\\ln y=\\lim_{x\\rightarrow 0+}\\frac{\\frac{1}{1+x}-1}{2x}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\&amp;\\text{即}f(0+0)=\\lim_{x\\rightarrow 0+}y=e^{-\\frac{1}{2}}=f(0)\\\\&amp;\\therefore f(x) \\text{在}x=0 \\text{处连续}\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\because f(0-0)=\\lim_{x\\rightarrow 0}e^{-\\frac{1}{2}}=e^{-\\frac{1}{2}}=f(0),\\\\&amp;\\therefore f(x) \\text{在}x=0 \\text{处的右极限，记为}y=[\\frac{(1+x)^{\\frac{1}{x}}}{e}]^{\\frac{1}{x}}, \\text{则}\\\\&amp;\\ln y=\\frac{\\ln(1+x)-x}{x^2}, \\text{而}\\lim_{x\\rightarrow 0+}\\ln y=\\lim_{x\\rightarrow 0+}\\frac{\\frac{1}{1+x}-1}{2x}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\&amp;\\text{即}f(0+0)=\\lim_{x\\rightarrow 0+}y=e^{-\\frac{1}{2}}=f(0)\\\\&amp;\\therefore f(x) \\text{在}x=0 \\text{处连续}\\end{aligned}</div>"
